# Password visibility

Whenever a password is entered (login, change password, invite setup, or any new form), use the shared [`PasswordField`](src/components/PasswordField.jsx) component — do not use a bare `<input type="password">`.

- Eye toggle sits to the **right** of the field (show / hide).
- Keep `autoComplete` appropriate (`current-password` / `new-password`).
- Do not invent a one-off toggle; extend `PasswordField` if styling or props are missing.
